cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite the paper."
title: "FAct: a globally shared, transferable learnable activation"
abstract: >-
  FAct is one nonlinearity for a whole network: at K = 2, five scalars shared by
  every hidden layer, learned jointly with the weights and then frozen and
  installed in a different network as an ordinary fixed activation. This
  repository holds the activation, the ImageNet-1K source checkpoints, and the
  training code behind the paper's results.
